\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$37,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Will give the player an item once the game goes into Beta.</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Gift of Alpha Uncertainty</b> is an object available for purchase at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>, for $37,000.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Gift of Alpha Uncertainty cannot be opened at this time.\n</p><p>Initially introduced with a price of $17,000, the Gift of Alpha Uncertainty's historic pricing was completely random, fluctuating each day. After the map redesign, the Gift of Alpha Uncertainty was given its fixed price of $37,000.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"716ecbaa45c8ed74c88d6ae22db760c1\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:165px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Test_Gift-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:163px; width:115px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Test_Gift.png\" title=\"Test Gift.png (31 KB)\" style=\"height:163px; width:115px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Test_Gift.png/revision/latest?cb=20231220003139\" title=\"Test Gift.png (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Test gift\" height=\"163\" width=\"115\" data-image-name=\"Test Gift.png\" data-image-key=\"Test_Gift.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Test gift\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Test Gift.png (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Test gift\" height=\"163\" width=\"115\" data-image-name=\"Test Gift.png\" data-image-key=\"Test_Gift.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Test gift\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Test_Gift.png/revision/latest?cb=20231220003139\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Test gift</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When first added, the Gift of Alpha Uncertainty was only available for purchase at the Lighthouse. After the map redesign, a small part of the countertop at The Oak Depot was set aside for these gifts. During some holiday events, the Gift of Alpha Uncertainty becomes unavailable for purchase from The Oak Depot due to other gifts taking its place.</li>\n<li>The mesh used for the gift was commonly used for Roblox Christmas events, but the decal on the gift is unique to Oaklands.</li>\n<li>Currently, the Gift of Alpha Uncertainty has an internal timer of when to open. Since there is currently no determined date of Beta release, this timer is set to release on 03:14:07 UTC on 19 January 2038, which is the maximum Unix time can get to.</li>\n<li>Prior to the introduction of money donations, players would use these gifts as money equivalents, alongside other rare materials or objects like the <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Core</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902033503\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 75/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 80/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1535/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019514/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.369      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.369      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved i